sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as REPL: backtest run
    participant BE as BacktestEngine
    participant CK as SyntheticClock
    participant KV as KV (mocked)
    participant SA as StrategyAgent
    participant RA as RiskAgent
    participant PB as PaperBroker
    participant DB as backtest_runs

    U->>BE: start(symbol, dates, strategy)
    BE->>CK: init(start_date)
    loop each bar t in [start, end]
        CK->>KV: write horizon:price:{S} = bar.close
        BE->>SA: tick(t)
        SA->>RA: SIGNAL
        RA->>PB: ORDER_NEW (approved)
        PB-->>RA: FILL (AC slippage)
        BE->>BE: update virtual NAV
    end
    BE->>DB: persist run metrics
    DB-->>U: run_id + Sharpe + DD
